# Local research, review, and submission-working documents.
# Keep one concise public README; the runnable app's required index.html is not
# affected because these patterns are anchored to the repository root.
/*.html
*.md
!/README.md
/SUBMISSION/
/app/public/YANCE-*.html
/app/public/submission/*.png
/app/scripts/capture-submission-screenshots.mjs
